{"seq":2,"slug":"seller-fee-reporting-analytics","title":"卖家费用报表与披露：费用明细下载、对账口径与费用结构分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/settlement-reconciliation-reporting/seller-fee-reporting-analytics","wordCount":2507,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"卖家费用报表与披露-费用明细下载-对账口径与费用结构分析\">卖家费用报表与披露：费用明细下载、对账口径与费用结构分析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>计费引擎算出的费用分录，对卖家而言必须变成<strong>可下载、可核对、可解释</strong>的报表——否则「佣金扣了多少」只是黑箱数字，卖家无法入账、无法申诉、无法定价。费用报表因此承担三种职能：<strong>明细下载</strong>（导出成可导入 ERP 的平面文件或可拉取的 API 流）、<strong>对账口径</strong>（说明与卖家账簿的差额从何而来）、<strong>结构分析</strong>（把费用拆成类目占比）。三者共享同一份分录真相源，但聚合维度与时效不同。</p>\n<p>平台侧的报表表面据此分成两类：报税要全量可留存，日常运营要近实时可查询。Stripe 用一套 <code>balance_transaction</code> 对象同时支撑两者——<code>type</code> 给出活动类型，<code>reporting_category</code> 给出会计分类，<code>fee_details</code> 数组给出费用拆分（<a href=\"https://docs.stripe.com/api/balance_transactions/object\">Stripe API reference</a>）。Amazon 拆成两条：<code>GET_V2_SETTLEMENT_REPORT_DATA_FLAT_FILE_V2</code> 走批量报表，Finances API 走流式查询。两类表面的字段、币种、时间戳语义互不一致，是对账差异的第一大来源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[(费用分录&lt;br/&gt;append-only 真相源)] --&gt; B[批量报表&lt;br/&gt;settlement flat file]&#10;    A --&gt; C[流式 API&lt;br/&gt;listTransactions]&#10;    A --&gt; D[预估类报表&lt;br/&gt;fee preview / holds]&#10;    B --&gt; E[导入 ERP 入账]&#10;    C --&gt; F[逐笔程序化核对]&#10;    D --&gt; G[上架前费用披露]&#10;    E --&gt; H[对账引擎&lt;br/&gt;账单 vs 账簿差异分类]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[费用结构分析&lt;br/&gt;类目占比 / 有效费率漂移]\">graph TD\n    A[(费用分录&lt;br/&gt;append-only 真相源)] --&gt; B[批量报表&lt;br/&gt;settlement flat file]\n    A --&gt; C[流式 API&lt;br/&gt;listTransactions]\n    A --&gt; D[预估类报表&lt;br/&gt;fee preview / holds]\n    B --&gt; E[导入 ERP 入账]\n    C --&gt; F[逐笔程序化核对]\n    D --&gt; G[上架前费用披露]\n    E --&gt; H[对账引擎&lt;br/&gt;账单 vs 账簿差异分类]\n    F --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[费用结构分析&lt;br/&gt;类目占比 / 有效费率漂移]</pre><h2 id=\"费用明细下载-批量报表-流式-api-与字段口径\">费用明细下载：批量报表、流式 API 与字段口径</h2><p>Amazon 的明细下载有两个并列出口。<strong>结算平面文件 V2</strong> 用 24 个字段描述一笔交易，其中 <code>GET_V2_SETTLEMENT_REPORT_DATA_FLAT_FILE</code> 与后缀 <code>_XML</code> 已弃用，新接入应直接用 V2（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/report-type-values-settlement.md\">SP-API 结算报表文档</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>对账用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>settlement-id</code> / <code>deposit-date</code></td>\n<td>账期标识与打款日期</td>\n<td>对账主键、匹配银行流水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>settlement-start/end-date</code></td>\n<td>账期起止</td>\n<td>边界归属判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>total-amount</code> / <code>currency</code></td>\n<td>账期总额与币种</td>\n<td>恒等式两端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>transaction-type</code> / <code>order-id</code></td>\n<td>交易类型、订单与行标识</td>\n<td>逐笔核对台账</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>amount-type</code></td>\n<td>金额分组（ItemPrice / ItemFees / Promotion / Other）</td>\n<td>报表第一层分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>amount-description</code></td>\n<td>费用描述（Principal / Commission / …）</td>\n<td>报表第二层分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>posted-date</code></td>\n<td>入账时点</td>\n<td>跨期归属</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>流式 API</strong> 侧，<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/finances-api-v2024-06-19-reference.md\">Finances API v2024-06-19</a> 的 <code>listTransactions</code>（<code>GET /finances/2024-06-19/transactions</code>）限速 0.5 req/s、突发 10；查询跨度<strong>上限 180 天</strong>，且<strong>最近 48 小时内的订单可能尚未出现</strong>。拉取器因此只能按天增量、按窗口重拉去重，不能做实时对账。费用拆分走递归结构 <code>breakdowns</code>（<code>breakdownType</code> + <code>breakdownAmount</code> + 嵌套），<code>currencyAmount</code> 是 <code>BigDecimal</code>，金额比较不能用浮点。交易状态 <code>DEFERRED</code> / <code>RELEASED</code> / <code>DEFERRED_RELEASED</code> 正是延期结算（B2B、DD7 账期）在报表层的体现。</p>\n<p><strong>预估类报表</strong>是「事前披露」的载体。FBA 枚举包括 <code>GET_FBA_ESTIMATED_FBA_FEES_TXT_DATA</code>（费用预估）、<code>GET_FBA_STORAGE_FEE_CHARGES_DATA</code>（月度仓储费）、<code>GET_FBA_OVERAGE_FEE_CHARGES_DATA</code>（超量费）、<code>GET_FBA_FULFILLMENT_LONGTERM_STORAGE_FEE_CHARGES_DATA</code>（长期仓储费），见 <a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/report-type-values-fba.md\">FBA 报表类型文档</a>；另有 <code>GET_DATE_RANGE_FINANCIAL_HOLDS_DATA</code>（延期交易报表），含 <code>selling-fees</code>、<code>fba-fees</code>、<code>other-transaction-fees</code>（<a href=\"https://developer-docs.amazon.com/sp-api/docs/report-type-values-payment.md\">Payment 报表类型文档</a>）。这类报表无真实成交价、无促销分摊、不含退款冲回，<strong>只能用于展示与决策，绝不作为入账或对账依据</strong>，UI 必须标注「预估」。下载的明细如何与平台账本、银行到账三方对齐，见 <a href=\"settlement-payout-ledger-reconciliation\">结算打款与账户账本</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账口径-账单-流水-费用三层如何对齐\">对账口径：账单、流水、费用三层如何对齐</h2><p>卖家手上至少有三份数据：平台<strong>账单</strong>（payout/statement）、平台<strong>费用明细</strong>（settlement 行）、<strong>自己的账簿</strong>。三者金额不可能天然相等，因为边界定义不同。对账引擎的职责不是让差额为零，而是把差额<strong>分类到一个封闭的原因集合</strong>里。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异来源</th>\n<th>典型现象</th>\n<th>归因口径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>账期边界跨期</td>\n<td>上月末订单落在本期账单</td>\n<td>按 <code>posted-date</code> 而非下单日期归属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>币种折算时点</td>\n<td>同笔订单两期金额不同</td>\n<td>期初/期末汇率 vs 逐笔交易日汇率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延期结算</td>\n<td><code>DEFERRED</code> 金额未入本期</td>\n<td>按 <code>transactionStatus</code> 分层核对</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>储备金冻结</td>\n<td>账单金额小于明细合计</td>\n<td>reserve hold/release 单独成行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退款冲回</td>\n<td>费用在退款期而非销售期冲正</td>\n<td>按冲回分录的期间匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>促销/广告分摊</td>\n<td>明细有、账簿无</td>\n<td>分摊规则须与卖家约定并披露</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>恒等式必须逐期闭合，且要能按<strong>卖家 × 站点 × 币种 × 账期</strong>四个键同时验证：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>payout</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>carryIn</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mtext>sales</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>fee</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>refund</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>adj</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mtext>reserve</mtext><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{payout}_{t} = \\text{carryIn}_{t} + \\sum_{k}\\big(\\text{sales}_{k} - \\text{fee}_{k} - \\text{refund}_{k} + \\text{adj}_{k}\\big) - \\Delta\\text{reserve}_{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8592em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">payout</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">carryIn</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sales</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fee</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">refund</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">adj</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reserve</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 遍历账期内所有分录。工程上把恒等式的每一项落成可点击的数字：卖家点开总额看到构成它的每个类目，再点开类目看到每笔分录——这是「可解释」的操作化定义。账期切分与结转模型见 <a href=\"../billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/billing-cycle-statement-generation\">账期与账单生成</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>重算而非修改</strong>是同一条约束的另一面。调账应追加一条调账分录并重新生成账单，而不是原地改数，否则历史已下载的明细与当前报表不一致；调账类型见 <a href=\"../billing-cycle-adjustment-dispute/adjustment-credit-note-policy\">调账与信用单据</a>。差异表每一行都应带<strong>可复算的样本</strong>（<code>order-id</code>、<code>amount-type</code>、<code>amount-description</code>、金额）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费用结构分析-类目占比-有效费率与漂移检测\">费用结构分析：类目占比、有效费率与漂移检测</h2><p>卖家真正关心的不是单笔佣金，而是<strong>成本结构</strong>。**有效费率（effective take rate, ETR）**定义为平台扣除的全部费用占成交额的比重：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ETR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>period</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mtext>fee</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>period</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mtext>gross</mtext><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ETR} = \\frac{\\sum_{k \\in \\text{period}} \\text{fee}_{k}}{\\sum_{k \\in \\text{period}} \\text{gross}_{k}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ETR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6976em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5758em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gross</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">period</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fee</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母必须是<strong>同口径成交额</strong>（含税费与运费与否要固定），否则跨期对比无意义。Amazon 的佣金按「标价 + 运费 + 包装费」总额计算，且多数类目有最低佣金（见 <a href=\"https://sell.amazon.com/pricing\">Amazon 定价页</a>：专业计划每月 <code>$39.99</code>，个人计划每件 <code>$0.99</code>，多数类目最低佣金 <code>$0.30</code>）。低客单价商品的 ETR 会被最低佣金显著抬高——这是结构分析中最常见的误读点。</p>\n<p><strong>类目占比</strong>把费用拆成 referral（佣金）、payment processing、fulfillment（履约）、storage（仓储）、advertising 等桶，占比趋势比绝对值更有信息量。仓储费与超量费有明显季节性，<strong>必须做同比而非环比</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>费率漂移检测</strong>回答「这一期费用为什么突然高了」——把 ETR 按维度切片做异常检验。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检测维度</th>\n<th>异常信号</th>\n<th>常见真因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按类目</td>\n<td>某类目 ETR 单期跳升超阈值</td>\n<td>类目费率调整未同步进费率卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按 SKU 尺寸分段</td>\n<td>小件 ETR 上升</td>\n<td>尺寸分段判定错误导致履约费升档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按客单价区间</td>\n<td>低价段 ETR 上升</td>\n<td>最低佣金命中率上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按站点/币种</td>\n<td>单站点 ETR 跳升</td>\n<td>汇率口径或本地费种新增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按促销参与</td>\n<td>参与促销后 ETR 上升</td>\n<td>促销费用未按约定分摊</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>费率卡版本化是这条链路的前提：费率若在账期中途变更，同一账期内存在两套费率，ETR 会呈现混合值。规则版本与幂等键设计见 <a href=\"../fee-calculation-charge-engine/charge-engine-architecture-idempotency\">计费引擎架构与幂等</a>，取整与分摊口径见 <a href=\"../charge-basis-rate-card-engine/rounding-allocation-currency-precision\">取整与分摊</a>。任何 ETR 数字旁都必须带<strong>口径声明</strong>（分母、时间范围、币种、费率卡版本）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"披露合规-p2b-与-dac7-的报表义务\">披露合规：P2B 与 DAC7 的报表义务</h2><p><strong>欧盟 P2B 条例（Regulation (EU) 2019/1150）<strong>规范平台对商业卖家的透明度（<a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/eur/2019/1150\">全文</a>）。<strong>Article 3</strong> 要求条款以「plain and intelligible language」撰写、各阶段易于获取，变更须提前通知且</strong>通知期至少 15 天</strong>（需技术或商业适配时可更长），违反的变更「null and void」；<strong>Article 5(3)</strong> 要求披露付费排名影响（「direct or indirect remuneration」）及其效果；<strong>Article 7(3)(c)(d)</strong> 要求披露在线中介服务、相关服务与技术接口收取的一切直接/间接报酬；<strong>Article 9</strong> 要求说明卖家对数据的访问范围，含<strong>聚合形式</strong>的平台整体数据，向第三方共享非「necessary for the proper functioning」的数据时须提供<strong>退出选择</strong>。费率披露义务落在 5(3) 与 7(3) 的「remuneration」上，工程含义是<strong>费率变更必须走带版本、有生效日的通知流程</strong>。</p>\n<p>**DAC7（Council Directive (EU) 2021/514）**修订 Directive (EU) 2011/16/EU，要求数字平台运营商尽调并报告卖家信息（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32021L0514\">EUR-Lex 全文</a>）。报告字段明确包含「考虑金额、活动或交易数量、费用、佣金、退款与代扣税」，并含卖家身份、地址、税号、出生日期、金融账户。<strong>去 minimis 门槛</strong>：单期活动少于 30 笔且金额未超过 EUR 2000 可豁免，触及任一门槛即需报告；<strong>申报期限为次年 1 月 31 日，首个报告年度为 2023 年。</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法规</th>\n<th>覆盖对象</th>\n<th>报表义务</th>\n<th>关键数字</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>P2B (EU) 2019/1150</td>\n<td>平台 → 商业卖家</td>\n<td>费率与排名付费披露、数据访问说明</td>\n<td>条款变更通知 ≥ 15 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DAC7 (EU) 2021/514</td>\n<td>平台 → 税务机关</td>\n<td>卖家身份、收入、费用/佣金、退款、代扣税</td>\n<td>&lt;30 笔且 ≤ EUR 2000；截止 1 月 31 日</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>合规口径对报表系统有两个硬要求：其一，<strong>按卖家维度可重放的年度汇总</strong>——DAC7 按报告年度聚合，而账期是平台视角的切分，二者不对齐，必须能在任意年度区间重算；其二，<strong>披露与计税是同一次数据的两个投影</strong>——若 DAC7 报表的费用合计与卖家账单不一致，平台会同时面对税务与信任两个问题。避免方式是让两者读同一份分录真相源。代扣税与发票在结算流水中的位置见 <a href=\"tax-withholding-regulatory-compliance\">税务代扣代缴与合规</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>费用报表的四个表面——批量结算报表、流式 API、预估类报表、支付/延期报表——各有独立的字段与时效口径；对齐字段名、币种、时间戳语义是主要工程量。</li>\n<li>Amazon 结算平面文件 V2 的 24 个字段是对账主数据；Finances API v2024-06-19 的 0.5 req/s 限速、180 天查询上限、48 小时事件延迟决定了它只能做准实时增量。</li>\n<li>对账的目标不是差额为零，而是把差额归入封闭原因集合（跨期、汇率、延期、储备、退款冲回、分摊、舍入），并给出可独立复算的样本。</li>\n<li>ETR 分母口径必须固定；最低佣金使低客单价商品的 ETR 系统性偏高，是最常见的结构分析误读点。</li>\n<li>费率卡必须版本化并带生效日；P2B 要求条款变更通知期至少 15 天，DAC7 要求报告费用、佣金、退款与代扣税（门槛 &lt;30 笔且 ≤ EUR 2000，截止次年 1 月 31 日）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"卖家费用报表与披露：费用明细下载、对账口径与费用结构分析","id":"卖家费用报表与披露-费用明细下载-对账口径与费用结构分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"费用明细下载：批量报表、流式 API 与字段口径","id":"费用明细下载-批量报表-流式-api-与字段口径"},{"level":2,"text":"对账口径：账单、流水、费用三层如何对齐","id":"对账口径-账单-流水-费用三层如何对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"费用结构分析：类目占比、有效费率与漂移检测","id":"费用结构分析-类目占比-有效费率与漂移检测"},{"level":2,"text":"披露合规：P2B 与 DAC7 的报表义务","id":"披露合规-p2b-与-dac7-的报表义务"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"结算打款与卖家账户账本：三方对账、余额滚动与差异处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/settlement-reconciliation-reporting/settlement-payout-ledger-reconciliation"},"next":{"title":"税务代扣代缴与合规：增值税/预扣税、发票开具与监管报送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-commission-fee-billing-settlement/settlement-reconciliation-reporting/tax-withholding-regulatory-compliance"}}